#: ../developer/code-structure.md:24
msgid ""
"The control plane and host are independently deployed implementations. "
"Neither imports the other. Shared code provides the facts and contracts they"
" agree on; it imports neither implementation. Accounts, admission and usage "
"live in the agent database; model calls go from the sandbox to the owner's "
"provider."
msgstr ""
"控制平面和主机是分别部署的两套实现，互不导入。共享代码提供双方共同认可的事实和契约，它不导入任何一方的实现。账号、准入和用量都在 agent "
"数据库中；模型调用从沙箱直接发往所有者的服务商。"

