#: ../developer/code-structure.md:64
msgid ""
"`app.py` mounts the owner/admin API and the separate MCP-only listener. It "
"installs shared HTTP response and exception policies, and on both listeners "
"a dependency that runs ahead of every route's own (`api/_parameters.py`): a "
"path or query parameter holding NUL, or a route's integer parameter too wide"
" for a `bigint`, is refused with a 422 before any query reads it. So is a "
"JSON body holding NUL or half a surrogate pair, on a route an owner, an "
"administrator or the on-call relay calls; host and sandbox reports keep "
"their own models, which replace those characters instead. "
"`bootstrap/lifespan.py` constructs the resources and starts and stops "
"background work; route modules do not own service startup or shutdown."
msgstr ""
"`app.py` 挂载所有者/管理员 API 和单独的 MCP 专用监听器，并装上统一的 HTTP "
"响应和异常处理策略。两个监听器上还都装了一个依赖，它排在每个路由自己的依赖之前（`api/_parameters.py`）：路径或查询参数里带 "
"NUL，或者路由的整数参数超出了 `bigint` 的范围，都会在任何查询读到它之前直接返回 422。由所有者、管理员或值班中继调用的路由，JSON "
"请求体里带 NUL "
"或者只有半个代理对，也一样拒绝；主机和沙箱的上报有自己的模型，会把这些字符替换掉，而不是拒绝。`bootstrap/lifespan.py` "
"负责创建资源，以及启动、停止后台任务；服务的启动和关闭不归路由模块管。"

