#: ../developer/code-structure.md:203
msgid ""
"`drivers.py` keeps the generic Driver, Session and Turn contract and the "
"base classes the sessions share. `resident_transport.py` opens member "
"processes and journals native Forks. It does not branch on the CLI to "
"launch one: each CLI's `member` module defines that CLI's launch steps "
