#: ../developer/code-structure.md:242
msgid ""
"Backend architecture checks enforce service-image independence, API import "
"direction, domain/port independence, and repository isolation. Backend "
"imports must use the installed package names (`cloud_agent`, "
"`cloud_agent_host`, and `cloud_agent_shared`), rather than the checkout "
"namespace `apps.backend`. The host image flattens these packages, so "
"checkout-prefixed imports can work locally and fail after deployment; the "
"guards reject them in all three packages. The import scanners include "
"relative imports, imports inside functions, and `TYPE_CHECKING` blocks. "
"Backend behavior tests remain under `tests/`; frontend tests remain "
"alongside the feature or utility they exercise."
msgstr ""
"后端的架构检查会确保：服务镜像彼此独立、API 的导入方向正确、domain 和 port 不依赖其他层、repository "
"被隔离。后端导入必须用安装后的包名（`cloud_agent`、`cloud_agent_host` 和 "
"`cloud_agent_shared`），不能用仓库里的命名空间 "
"`apps.backend`。主机镜像会把这些包展平，带仓库前缀的导入在本地也许能用，部署后就会失败，所以三个包里都会拦下这种写法。导入扫描会覆盖相对导入、函数内部的导入和"
" `TYPE_CHECKING` 块。后端的行为测试放在 `tests/` 下；前端测试和它测试的功能或工具函数放在一起。"

